OL,3,GNEWSADrunk council leader accused of
OL,4,Adrinking bottle of gin and vowing to
OL,5,A'wipe out' Plaid Cymru quits
OL,6,
OL,7,FA council leader who fell over while
OL,8,Fdrunk after allegations he drank a
OL,9,F"whole bottle of gin" and then
OL,10,Fthreatened to "wipe out" the Welsh
OL,11,Fparty Plaid Cymru has quit.
OL,13,FSteve Hunt, from Neath Port Talbot
OL,14,FCouncil, said he "should have exercised
OL,15,Fbetter judgement" after becoming
OL,16,F"intoxicated" at a Welsh Local
OL,17,FGovernment Association conference.
OL,19,FHunt said he was a strong supporter of
OL,20,Fthe Welsh language, but admitted saying
OL,21,Fhe wanted to "wipe out" Plaid Cymru
OL,22,Fpolitically as "banter".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
